#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Baseline Manifest Path"
msgstr "Lalan'ny Manifesta Fototra"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional path to a declarative YAML or XML baseline manifest used by drift checks, Doctor checks, and MCP status abilities."
msgstr "Lalana tsy voatery mankany amin'ny manifesta fototra fanambarana YAML na XML ampiasain'ny fanamarinana fiviliana, fanamarinana Doctor, ary fahaizan'ny toetra MCP."

#: lib/Settings.php
